and then GM

00:37:13.079 --> 00:37:15.829
and everybody came with a me too product; and then already

00:37:15.329 --> 00:37:16.329
taken the

00:37:16.329 --> 00:37:18.659
leadership technologically and in term of brand by

00:37:18.679 --> 00:37:19.679
introducing the

